#: kwindecoration.cpp:458
msgid ""
"<h1>Window Decorations</h1>"
"<p>This module allows you to choose the window border decorations, as well "
"as titlebar button positions and custom decoration options.</p>To choose a "
"theme for your window decoration click on the name of it and apply your "
"choice by clicking the \"Apply\" button right below. If you do not want to "
"apply your choice you might press the \"Reset\" button to discard your "
"changes."
"<p>You can configure each theme in the \"Configure[]\" tab. There are "
"different options specific for each theme.</p>"
"<p>As general option (if available) you can activate the \"Buttons\" tab by "
"checking the \"Use custom titlebar button positions\" box. In the "
"\"Buttons\" tab you can change the positions of your buttons, so that you "
"like your new style.</p>"
msgstr ""

